{"data": [{"author_id": "2108191189019381760", "created_at": "2026-10-29T01:10:35.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2115612224215814267"], "id": "2115612224215814267", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 284, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "高盛 A 股收盘\n\n上证指数 +0.91%|科创 50 +2.45%\n上证 50 +0.23%|创业板指 +3.40%\n沪深 300 +0.85%|中证 500 +1.99%\n全天总成交额 1.64 万亿元,较前一日上涨 11.49%\nA 股跟随亚太市场强势走势迎来修复反弹。\n上证指数下午盘中震荡加大,但是在 AI 供应链久违反弹的支撑之下,收盘收在高位。", "url": "https://x.com/2030FY_X/status/2115612224215814267"}, {"author_id": "1128198342859563008", "created_at": "2026-10-30T04:37:00.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2116026559425564748"], "id": "2116026559425564748", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 907, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "📌 高盛中国午评\n\n📊 SCHOMP -0.30% 科创 50 -1.75%\n上证 50 -0.29% 创业板指 -1.18%\n沪深 300 -0.38% 中证 500 -0.54%\n全 A 股成交额（人民币万亿元）1.02\n\n📉 今早中国 A 股市场出现明显的风险偏好回落行情，AI 硬件标的领跌，投资者正在消化不及预期的三季度业绩。\n⚡ CPO 以及 PCB", "url": "https://x.com/ming69621583/status/2116026559425564748"}, {"author_id": "1913965111045398528", "created_at": "2026-10-30T16:05:13.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2116199755995099626"], "id": "2116199755995099626", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 673, "like_count": 1, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "宽基 ETF", "url": "https://x.com/m0sHown5gS16742/status/2116199755995099626"}, {"author_id": "2108191189019381760", "created_at": "2026-10-29T11:59:54.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2115775630805778822"], "id": "2115775630805778822", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 906, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "交易台 - 高盛中国收评\n\n上证综指 - 0.82%、科创 50 -4.27%;\n上证 50 +0.36%、创业板指 -4.45%;\n沪深 300 -1.03%、中证 500 -2.82%。\n全市场总成交额 1.57 万亿元,环比下降 4.35%。\n\n国内 AI 板块波动延续,创业板指、科创 50 在前一日短暂反弹之后,今日双双跌超 4%。Alphabet", "url": "https://x.com/2030FY_X/status/2115775630805778822"}, {"author_id": "2077533448877858816", "created_at": "2026-10-30T19:38:34.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2116253446169043223"], "id": "2116253446169043223", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 13, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "大A十二连跌！这次到底发生了什么？\n截至10月30日，沪深300指数已经连续12周下跌，创下该指数有记录以来最长连续周跌纪录。上证指数也失守3600点，收于3599.02点。\n再看10月表现：创业板指单月下跌23.02%，创2016年2月以来最大单月跌幅；当天全市场超过4600只股票下跌，成交额约1.69万亿元。 https://t.co/MedKFdh6Gu", "url": "https://x.com/june52zg/status/2116253446169043223"}, {"author_id": "1128198342859563008", "created_at": "2026-10-29T11:17:51.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2115765049008808418"], "id": "2115765049008808418", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 668, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "交易台 - 高盛中国收评\n\n上证综指 - 0.82%、科创 50 -4.27%；\n上证 50 +0.36%、创业板指 -4.45%；\n沪深 300 -1.03%、中证 500 -2.82%。\n全市场总成交额 1.57 万亿元，环比下降 4.35%。\n\n国内 AI 板块波动延续，创业板指、科创 50 在前一日短暂反弹之后，今日双双跌超 4%。Alphabet", "url": "https://x.com/ming69621583/status/2115765049008808418"}, {"author_id": "1305374184", "created_at": "2026-10-30T12:07:24.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2116139908834467987"], "id": "2116139908834467987", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 512, "like_count": 2, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 1, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "五中全会闭幕次日 A股三大指数大跌！ https://t.co/7wsOGaP5ES", "url": "https://x.com/s_hxxtn/status/2116139908834467987"}, {"author_id": "1305374184", "created_at": "2026-10-29T12:16:40.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2115779851391324209"], "id": "2115779851391324209", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 648, "like_count": 1, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 1, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "五中全会A股继续跌 创业板指下挫4.45% 4728个股飘绿! https://t.co/Dy1BwVdfUZ", "url": "https://x.com/s_hxxtn/status/211577985139132420